thub.com/users/LNXSeus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-zip-compressed","state":"uploaded","size":131800813,"digest":"sha256:dc81eef1133fdd46db4d1cad7f71e2a529f21306fd10ca9293013fddf7de11f8","download_count":150,"created_at":"2026-07-08T00:14:22Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T00:15:49Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/download/v1.6.0/Advancely-v1.6.0-Windows.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/tarball/v1.6.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/zipball/v1.6.0","body":"## In this update the Overlay gets the long-awaited overhaul, along with many template editor improvements (suggested by ScrambledMC) and important fixes.\r\n\r\n\r\n> Watch [this Devlog](https://youtu.be/Z03mx5WiXH8?t=438) for an overview of this update.\r\n\r\n# Overlay\r\n\r\n- **Conveyor-belt motion**: All items now move in sync with no more relative jittering.\r\n- Completed items leave a gap through a cropping animation.\r\n- **Dynamic height**: The overlay window's height now dynamically adjusts based on overlay font size and vertical spacing.\r\n- Per-row scroll speed & direction.\r\n- **Auto-Freeze**: Shows each item once, without repeat when a few items remain.\r\n- Overlay restarts only when overlay-related settings were changed.\r\n- Static icons round to whole pixels to stay sharp.\r\n\r\n# Template Editor\r\n\r\n- Added colored **goal indicators** (Hidden, Row 2/Row 3, …), those indicators are also searchable.\r\n- Reorganized editing buttons. \r\n- Added proper **rename** that also renames the template's notes and snapshot files.\r\n- Create/copy/rename can now **replace an existing template** with the exact same naming (), without errors.\r\n- Imports from another template can now **import** across **multiple language files** at once (if the match).\r\n- Creating new multi-stage goal provides a **single regular stage** by default in addition to the final stage.\r\n- **Template count** now properly **refreshes** within the two dropdowns without a tracker restart.\r\n\r\n# Fixes\r\n\r\n- **Fixed** a severe overlay **memory leak**, where the text-texture cache was never properly freed and just accumulated.\r\n- macOS: Writable resource files (settings, templates, notes) now live in `~/Library/Application Support/Advancely`, fixing saves failing next to the .app bundle.\r\n- Every settings tooltip now shows its default value.\r\n- Hiding Mode dropdown properly fits all options.\r\n- `Hide Template-Hidden Only` is the new default.\r\n- New/updated content: `1.21.4` `all_advancements` template, `1.21.11`+ categorical (7 instead of 8 armadillo scutes), 26.2 biome textures & icons, and completion fixes (Netherite Upgrade trim, chest stat).\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n> Find more info on the [tracker main page](https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely)!\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n## *[Donations](https://streamlabs.com/lnxseus/tip) are always welcome\\! Make sure to mention `Advancely` in the donation message.*\r\n\r\nEnjoy the update\\!"}